WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.850
[Musik piano lan orkestra sing anget]

00:00.850 --> 00:02.318
Teka musim gugur iki.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.796
Dheweke ngerti sepira apike bocah.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.542
Dheweke ngerti dhaptar kekarepane.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.160
Dheweke ngerti jenenge.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.236
Rasakake Santa kanthi cara anyar.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
[Lonceng alus. Lonceng kreta salju.]
